# Line endings.
#
# Code is written on Linux and run on Windows, and this box has
# core.autocrlf=true, so without this a checkout here would hand `run.sh` a CRLF
# shebang — which bash rejects outright ("bad interpreter"). Normalize to LF in
# the repository and on checkout everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Except PowerShell, which is conventionally CRLF on Windows.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
